{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1393235-adapting-countless-dreams-to-mage","id":1393235,"title":"Adapting Countless Dreams to Mage","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-05-31T15:29:59-07:00","id":1393235,"title":"Adapting Countless Dreams to Mage","content":"So <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/m/product/314491\" target=\"_blank\">Countless Dreams</a> is a Storyteller's Vault supplement that does for Changeling what the Technocracy does for Mage: it adds a faction to the game (the Countless) that reframes everything in terms of sci-fi instead of fantasy. Put simply, the Countless are aliens, who come from alien environments (not just outer space; but also undersea, inside the Earth's mantle, the Digital Web, and even stranger places) and are trying to infiltrate our world in order to survive. <br /> <br /> I think there's a lot of material that could be useful in a Technocracy-oriented Mage game, particularly where the Void Engineers are concerned. But if you don't own C20, it might be hard to use it in that regard. Thus my question: how would you go about adapting this so that it can be used with just Mage books to present antagonists for the Void Engineers in particular, and for Mage protagonists in general? <br /> <br /> My initial thought is to recast the Countless as E.D.E.s, with their Arts replaced by Charms and their Theories (i.e., Changeling Realms) adapted somehow to empower what their Charms can normally do. The business about Joining with human hosts (to create something akin to a changeling) still exists but is downplayed; and when it does happen, the result is more akin to Werewolf's Fomori, Drones, Gorgons, or Kami(?) than to changelings. <br /> <br /> If done right, this might also be used to model members of Threat Null.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}